{"id":"en_therapy-or-temptation","title":"Therapy or Temptation","titleEn":"Therapy or Temptation","description":"Max is a well-respected therapist who keeps his true desires hidden behind a rigid, homophobic exterior. His carefully maintained control begins to unravel when he is compelled to take on Jack as a patient—a reckless and alluring soccer star ordered into therapy for sex addiction. With his family pushing him in one direction, a cheating fiancée in the picture, and Jack's powerful physical pull proving impossible to ignore, Max finds himself at a breaking point. He must decide whether to keep living a life built on suffocating falsehoods or to surrender to the passion he has long suppressed. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/therapy-or-temptation/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/therapy-or-temptation/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Forced Love","Redemption","Sweet Romance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9ug4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_therapy-or-temptation_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9ug4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_therapy-or-temptation_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9ug4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_therapy-or-temptation_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9ug4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_therapy-or-temptation_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"